# v3.0.0

- Expanded supported organisms from 8 to ~300 representative species.
- Implemented frontend logic to read compressed databases
- Added support for Orthologous Group IDs
- Refactored clade naming to specify LCA (Last Common Ancestor)
- Integrated a native dark mode toggle with full CSS variable theming.
- Added support for exporting visualizations as SVG or PNG.
- Nodes now pin coordinates when changing clades to maintain visual context.
- Added a dedicated box for unconnected nodes in the network view.
- Added options to toggle gene names and dynamically increase font sizes in PPI graphs.
- Improved layouts for small displays and mobile accessibility.
- Fixed table ordering during CSV exports
- Added persistent warnings for missing genes
- Parallelized database creation processes and updated Nextflow configurations for better memory management.
- Expanded the "About" page with code examples for database access and input format guides.

